artscience|-|The ArtScience Museum in Singapore (white lotus-shaped building with ten curved petal fingers rising from a round glass base)
supertree|-|A Supertree from Gardens by the Bay in Singapore (tall tapering steel trunk wrapped in green vertical-garden plants and purple flowers, topped by a wide open purple steel-lattice canopy like an umbrella)
esplanade|-|Esplanade Theatres on the Bay in Singapore (two large rounded dome buildings covered in spiky triangular golden aluminium sunshades, like durian fruits, glass base)
gct|-|The front facade of Grand Central Terminal in New York (Beaux-Arts limestone facade with three huge arched windows between pairs of columns, the Tiffany clock and sculpture group of Mercury on top)
bethesda|-|Bethesda Fountain in Central Park New York (bronze Angel of the Waters statue with spread wings on top of a two-tier fountain with four cherub figures, in a round stone basin)
brooklyn-tower|-|One stone tower of the Brooklyn Bridge in New York (tall granite and limestone tower with two pointed gothic arches, steel suspension cables attached, a short section of the bridge deck)
